Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:02.20,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,相當有感覺　無敵的POWER！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.57,0:01:05.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,真的感覺不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:08.59,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:12.20,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,來　向著明天前進吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.57,0:01:26.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,只要接觸就能了解　心的極限
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.03,0:01:29.77,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:33.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes! Change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:36.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,激烈的戰鬥　不管多少次都要嘗試！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:40.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,貫徹真實
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.03,0:01:43.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:46.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,驚險刺激最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:53.83,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣開始照亮世界的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.83,0:01:59.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,充滿你給予的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:06.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,將不似任何人的笑容作為榮耀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.78,0:02:11.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,現在超越未來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:15.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,We can try over the future world!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:16.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:17.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,最大 !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:20.83,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,大膽 !
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.63,0:22:16.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 你是我命中注定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.05,0:22:16.39,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.30,0:22:36.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在你面前的話　你看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.40,0:22:43.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連超能力也派不上用場
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.23,0:22:50.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連畢達哥拉斯　也無法弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:53.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,戀愛是智慧之輪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.38,0:23:00.04,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,一副要哭的樣子　低著頭是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.54,0:23:05.40,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有笑容　才能產生奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:07.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,DA DA 命中注定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.35,0:23:07.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,啾啾 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.65,0:23:08.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想把你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.65,0:23:09.07,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨嗨 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.07,0:23:12.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,變成大膽無敵的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.96,0:23:17.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓人無比沉醉　這是真的　絕對的 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.03,0:23:18.41,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,DA DA 大變身
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:18.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,啾啾 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.74,0:23:19.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.71,0:23:20.34,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨嗨 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.34,0:23:25.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,爆炸性的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.29,0:23:28.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你能喜歡　絕對 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.08,0:23:33.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 你是我命中注定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:38.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 你是我命中注定的人
Comment: 0,0:23:38.30,0:23:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.91,0:00:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名字取什麼好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.36,0:00:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須考慮男孩子和女孩子這兩種情況
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  我是爸爸喲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.03,0:00:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  光雄
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  菫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.14,0:00:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想把這作為生下來後的驚喜  不要告訴我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是超能力者啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩種情況的名字我都會想的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是男孩子就叫一郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…  或是取國際通用的魯路洛夫之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.39,0:00:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力者？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在今天診察的時候知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然醫生說生下來後那能力也有可能會消失
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光雄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(670,570)\fad(500,500)}25th  sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(770,600)\fad(500,500)}「安產祈願！你好、小嬰兒」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒找到兵部少佐嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們已經盡力了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外在世界各地不時出現擁有強大力量的超能力者  行蹤不明或是從監獄裡消失的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是兵部搞的鬼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為不能排除這個可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說有相當數量的超能力者聚集到兵部手下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L.…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.69,0:03:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想創造超能力者和普通人攜手共進  友好相處的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:10.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管什麼潘多拉  或者女王
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:10.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs20\pos(630,660)}P.A.N.D.R.A
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:10.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(790.,660)}Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.59,0:03:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不會讓他們妨礙我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進展順利嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  一切都按計劃進行中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  辛苦你了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛撿到你的時候你還只是個小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在卻完全變成大叔了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你如果也能稍微成熟一點的話就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.61,0:03:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要  麻煩的事情就全交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多要到防護帶了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了  我們潘多拉的故鄉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs20\pos(694,660)}P.A.N.D.R.A
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能別把瓜子殼弄到我身上嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰什麼時候會來這島上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要著急  還需要再等一段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要等多久
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也會發覺的  超能力者和普通人無法共存
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.05,0:04:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信不用多久
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是讓人盼望啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.37,0:05:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到那個時候  我得作為前輩好好疼她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個時候很快就會來臨  女王
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  取消…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老媽  上次也是這樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老姐也來不了了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛  真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好  我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一個人吃完就回去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  用不著這麼道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,努力工作吧  再見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  虧我還這麼期待
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對ChilChil
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.61,0:05:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:56.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.25,0:05:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎回來  聚餐開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.37,0:05:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.23,0:06:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吃得太飽  先睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:12.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.63,0:06:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要注意車輛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.69,0:06:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  昨晚發生什麼事了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼什麼啊…沒什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:30.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是千里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:39.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們三人經常早退或請假  為什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.57,0:06:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃  因為有很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比方說事件之類的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是父…父母工作上的關係
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.55,0:07:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我們的父母都是做同樣工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:06.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這樣不行啊  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要保密
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是做什麼工作的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃…那是…Pass
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:21.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃…這…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給你了  Pass
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公務員哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.12,0:07:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:27.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣  就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公務員也有很多種的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且那個大哥哥  是叫皆本先生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東野
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.49,0:07:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲  明石
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:43.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用貝獨樂決勝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:44.88,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,（註：獨樂是指陀螺，最早是竹子做的，到江戶時期\N是在海螺殼頂端灌注鉛，讓陀螺旋轉的更穩，因此叫貝獨樂。\N現在多為木製。用於比賽的鐵芯陀螺叫“beylade”）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就做好覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:47.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求之不得
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.61,0:07:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺明石同學她們好像在隱瞞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也沒贏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.73,0:08:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真要超能力者和普通人要友好相處的話該怎麼做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:16.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明石同學
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要發呆  現在在上課哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.49,0:08:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰她怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼心事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.71,0:08:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才應該說對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是孕婦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:08:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像在煩惱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是在傷心？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.55,0:09:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在傷心？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:11.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過要生小孩不是很開心的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.87,0:09:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想應該沒有不覺得開心的父母吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽生我時也很開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使我是超能力者？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:23.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼這麼問
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:25.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是很開心的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很開心你們能生到這世上來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才能夠如此相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.65,0:09:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  葵  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.39,0:09:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們生到這世上來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.47,0:09:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  不要說些讓人不好意思的話嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.46,0:09:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能不要相遇比較好…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.87,0:10:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}増量中　だぞ{\r}\N增量中  是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:10.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}ゾウの赤ちゃんだよ　バウ{\r}\N大象寶寶哦  吧嗚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豪野山發生了大規模的山崩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隧道崩塌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.69,0:10:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行進中的車輛有數台被困在裡面了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.56,0:10:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊超能力者  立即出動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:32.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,數台車輛被困在隧道中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用重工機械救援的話太耗費時間
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  馬上開展救援行動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.73,0:10:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:45.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要讓媒體的直升機離開這現場
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能讓他們拍到這些孩子的外貌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.45,0:10:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  局長
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.43,0:10:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.46,0:10:54.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在看什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:56.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備好船
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛤？！  命令？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢…慢著…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.71,0:11:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次整裝出發
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊超能力者 The Children  解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管風吹雨打
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要遇到困難之人就要伸出援手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:19.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要做這樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.67,0:11:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.81,0:11:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,輕傷  只是昏過去了而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明…明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一瞬間的功夫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.01,0:11:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好強大的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.97,0:11:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不需要我們嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.83,0:11:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…沒有這回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力不是萬能的  而且那些孩子也不是魔法師
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不能以為只要有強大的力量就能解決一切
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在場的全體人員都要竭盡所能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說是超能力者  但她們都還是不成熟的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:05.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力在普通生活中只是累贅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了那些孩子自己  也為了其他眾多的超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些孩子必須要一直實踐並且證明
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.77,0:12:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,證明？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.37,0:12:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力是能夠保護他人並帶給人們幸福的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:25.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在  葵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.89,0:12:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胸口受到撞擊昏過去了  不過沒有生命危險
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還剩多少人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的就只有計程車的乘客了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,簡單啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:43.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包在我們身上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  這樣就能救出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  這個人…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個時候的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子裡的孩子沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是母親就…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:08.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點送去醫院吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:09.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們就回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:15.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵…身體！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.11,0:13:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼  發生問題？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.95,0:13:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.79,0:13:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧  該不會是受傷了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.01,0:13:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…並不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說清楚  發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵的瞬移好像狀態不好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.10,0:13:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我出去  薰  快拉我出來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.61,0:13:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的超能力好像也變弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像回不去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.11,0:13:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的力量也變弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無法看到更深層的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.34,0:13:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:56.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原因是這個嬰兒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:57.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:02.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是超能力者  而且力量相當強大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這孩子的念波在干涉我們的超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嬰兒是超能力者？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎麼辦  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:18.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用重型機械救援最快也要半天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.80,0:14:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能撐到那個時候嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.35,0:14:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撐不了太久
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.81,0:14:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母親很衰弱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.22,0:14:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們安心等著
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  薰  能聽到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:33.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗  葵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.49,0:14:37.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通信中斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是因為嬰兒的力量嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.87,0:14:46.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生打算怎麼做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.48,0:14:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然說了「安心等著」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.48,0:14:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能相信他了  我們在這裡等著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.86,0:14:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生一定會來救我們的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:14:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.06,0:15:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這孩子在害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.97,0:15:05.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害怕自己被生出來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:14.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為爸爸媽媽害怕生出超能力者啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感受到這點  所以對生到外面的世界而感到不安
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.91,0:15:22.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以暴走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菫  繪理香  一郎 還有魯路洛夫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢…慢著
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在就去救你們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:16:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菫  繪理香  一郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.78,0:16:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生  準備馬上就要完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.94,0:16:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊  魯路洛夫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡很危險  請離開
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一定會把她們救出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.30,0:16:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.91,0:16:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有點辛苦啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要一臉陰沉的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本馬上就會來救我們的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.45,0:16:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…我會撐到那個時候的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  小寶寶  你能聽到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.10,0:16:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們作為超能力者而出生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:56.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遇到過很多不開心的  悲傷的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.79,0:16:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父母也害怕我們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能去上學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也沒有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力者也是會有好事的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.89,0:17:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有很多開心的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為有人說過  能與我們相遇實在太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有什麼好怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是有我們在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  我們一定會保護你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  所以你就安心地生下來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.65,0:17:47.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,位置沒有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰到極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請瞄準岩石內部的大裂縫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  直美  準備好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.64,0:17:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  隨時可以行動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:18:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  計算沒有出錯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:05.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且  薰支撐的岩石應該會保護大家的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發射！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.47,0:18:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家  趁現在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.82,0:18:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:18:55.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們真的是很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以瞬移了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.22,0:19:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寶寶明白了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得…得救了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.81,0:19:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  菫  繪理香  一郎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們沒事真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們真的很努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  來的太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.35,0:19:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是  我們都等的不耐煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:33.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是千鈞一髮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.31,0:19:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正確把握你們的位置  以及斷崖的狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有射束射擊的地點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備突入的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.92,0:19:44.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些都是必須的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都是託大家的福
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:47.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:49.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  大家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.61,0:19:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L.的大家  急救隊  消防員…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:55.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是大家齊心合力的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.75,0:19:58.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們真是很努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.66,0:20:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看  超能力者也是會遇到好事的 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.95,0:20:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是B.A.B.E.L.所期盼的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.15,0:20:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力者和普通人能夠互相合作 友好共處的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  這樣的未來一定會到來的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.07,0:20:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看著那些孩子我就更加堅信了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.51,0:20:37.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我不會讓你們來亂攪的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潘多拉  兵部
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幫了薰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正是不會被發現的程度
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想讓女王受傷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且那個嬰兒將來也可能會成為我們的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.87,0:20:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還真是不會放過小孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.73,0:21:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼  你這齧齒類
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:01.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你個Loli控
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於生下來了  感謝你生下來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.21,0:21:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個家庭一定會順順利利的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父親母親都是打從心底感到高興啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠平安無事生下來真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有會對自己孩子的出生感到不開心的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力者和普通人一定能夠友好相處的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定能的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想要皆本的小寶寶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.89,0:21:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  我也要  我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  你們知道怎樣才能生小孩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚  皆本知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.64,0:21:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要一個女孩子和一個男孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要雙胞胎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶吶  要怎麼做才能生小孩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.63,0:21:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要得寸進尺！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.91,0:22:02.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本生氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.18,0:22:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.17,0:22:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不明所以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.75,0:22:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  戲弄大人也要適可而止啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.26,0:23:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的預知是百發百中的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.21,0:23:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預知的事情是無法防止的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:47.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是怎樣的預知
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.30,0:23:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是本人之死
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.46,0:23:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是其實還有一個重大的預知
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.28,0:23:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果可以的話  希望能夠防止
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.18,0:23:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.69,0:23:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第26話  「改變預知？舞動未來！」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.99,0:24:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個距離能夠準確命中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.11,0:24:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開槍吧  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.32,0:24:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  薰！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.26,0:24:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

